      "SourceSection": "5.4: The Normal Curve",
      "SourceExcerpt": "In a similar way to how we can model data in a scatter plot with a line or other curve so that additional information can be estimated or predicted, it can be useful to model an approximately symmetric and bell-shaped distribution with a…",
