      "SourceSection": "5.4: The Normal Curve",
      "SourceExcerpt": "For the handspan data, the mean is 20.9 cm and the standard deviation is 1.41. The curve that represents the normal distribution with this same mean and standard deviation is shown on top of the relative frequency histogram for the actual…",
